                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Just to confirm, if both pwmx and fanx_target are present in the hwmon path, the sensor will always prefer pwmx for fan control, correct?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 22,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "NikhilaDande",
                        "email": "nikhilad@ami.com",
                        "username": "NikhilaDande"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, that's correct. If both pwmx and fanx_target are present in the hwmon path, the sensor will prioritize pwmx for fan control. It will only fall back to fanx_target if pwmx is not available."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 22,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "NikhilaDande",
                        "email": "nikhilad@ami.com",
                        "username": "NikhilaDande"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
